        <h2>Housing &amp; Homelessness</h2>
        <div class="issue-subtitle">Strongest alignment across all three levels</div>
      </div>
      <svg class="chevron" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M5 8l5 5 5-5"/></svg>
    </div>
    <div class="issue-body">
      <div class="govt-columns">
        <div class="govt-col">
          <h3><span class="h-dot" style="background:var(--accent-state)"></span> NM State</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>$110M for new housing units &amp; homelessness</li>
            <li>Zoning reform to accelerate production</li>
            <li>Interest-rate buydown for homeowners</li>
