        </div>
        <div class="govt-col">
          <h3><span class="h-dot" style="background:var(--accent-county)"></span> SF County</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>$10.35M for permanent supportive housing (FY27)</li>
            <li>Sustainable Land Development Code revisions</li>
            <li>Strategic plan top priority</li>
            <li>Joint working group with City on housing</li>
            <li>Reentry housing through NM Reentry org</li>
          </ul>
