      <div class="bridge-box">
        <div class="bridge-icon">&#9670;</div>
        <div class="bridge-text"><strong>CrSF bridge opportunity:</strong> All three are funding housing but residents affected by displacement, affordability and homelessness rarely shape the plans. A community listening event could surface where residents actually want housing, what "affordable" means in real terms, and which approaches (micro-communities, supportive housing, vouchers) communities will accept in their neighborhoods.</div>
