            <li>CONNECT navigation for food, housing, transport</li>
            <li>Health Policy &amp; Planning Commission active</li>
          </ul>
          <div class="source">Health Action Plan</div>
        </div>
        <div class="govt-col">
          <h3><span class="h-dot" style="background:var(--accent-city)"></span> City of Santa Fe</h3>
          <ul>
