    <div class="issue-body">
      <div class="govt-columns">
        <div class="govt-col">
          <h3><span class="h-dot" style="background:var(--accent-state)"></span> NM State</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>Not a headline legislative priority</li>
            <li>Bond rating upgrade reflects fiscal management</li>
          </ul>
          <div class="source">2026 State of the State</div>
        </div>
        <div class="govt-col">
          <h3><span class="h-dot" style="background:var(--accent-county)"></span> SF County</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>Department-level 3-year customer service plans</li>
            <li>KPIs on public dashboards</li>
            <li>Standardized performance reporting</li>
            <li>Past-accomplishment visibility push</li>
          </ul>
          <div class="source">Strategic Plan</div>
        </div>
        <div class="govt-col">
          <h3><span class="h-dot" style="background:var(--accent-city)"></span> City of Santa Fe</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>Independent Inspector General (new office)</li>
            <li>"Make government work better" strategic goal</li>
            <li>Data-driven decision-making emphasis</li>
            <li>Southside mayoral office (geographic access)</li>
          </ul>
          <div class="source">Mayor Garcia Inauguration &amp; FY27 Budget</div>
